{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:07.86] Mmmm\n[00:10.82] (Ayy, KBeaZy, you fired up)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:13.94] Every day I wake up, get to the cake\n[00:15.64] Rainy or sunny, it's money to make\n[00:17.28] If I'm down bad, it's just too bad\n[00:19.22] Hands in the air, all your money I'll take\n[00:20.70] Sitting up in the trap, with a safe like a bank\n[00:22.54] Ain't believe in me, niggas was sayin' I can't\n[00:24.40] Now I'm ridin' in a Hellcat, matte black paint\n[00:26.16] Moving slow like a snail in a Lambo race\n[00:28.14] Speed it up, speed it up, change the pace\n[00:30.04] Drown in lean and smoke the dank\n[00:31.74] My weed stank, it'll make you faint\n[00:33.40] Yo' nigga a joke, he a hoax and a prank\n[00:35.08] You get shot in the throat if you get in the way (Hey)\n[00:37.46] No hesitation, I don't blink (Hey)\n[00:39.42] It's gettin' cold outside (Hey)\n[00:41.14] So I went out and bought me a mink (Let's go)\n[Chorus]\n[00:43.20] All my niggas gon' ride (Hey)\n[00:44.82] All my niggas gon' slide (Okay)\n[00:46.66] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide\n[00:50.06] Hit him with the .9 knock him down a size (Fuck)\n[00:53.80] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)\n[00:57.38] All my niggas gon' ride (Yeah)\n[00:59.18] All my niggas gon' slide (Grrt, yeah)\n[01:01.36] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide (Oh yeah)\n[01:04.46] Hit him with the .9 (Brr, brr), knock him down to size (Brr, fuck)\n[01:08.32] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:11.80] I run with G-Money, we getting the millions\n[01:13.22] The sky is the limit, I don't got no limits\n[01:14.96] Gang, gang, gang, gang, bitch, I'm No Limit\n[01:16.74] I don't wanna drink Sprite if it ain't got a four in it\n[01:18.58] I ain't hop in the car if it don't got a pole in it\n[01:20.36] PJ to the A, I'ma buy new linens\n[01:22.18] Mansion in Atlanta just for Christmas\n[01:23.90] Kel-Tec and some Hi-Tech on my wishlist\n[01:25.72] I get high and tell all my demons go away\n[01:27.48] Diamonds on me, that's why I'm frozer than a wraith\n[01:29.36] I be fly as a superhero with a cape\n[01:31.12] All my hoodies orangutan, yeah they Bape\n[01:32.88] Poppin' wheelies on four wheelers, do a scrape\n[01:34.82] Or G-Money go one twenty in a straight\n[01:36.58] We get money like three hundred for the stage\n[01:38.24] Yeah, I run it, got my lyrics in their brains\n[Chorus]\n[01:40.30] All my niggas gon' ride\n[01:42.12] All my niggas gon' slide\n[01:43.82] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide\n[01:47.46] Hit him with the .9 knock him down a size (Fuck)\n[01:50.98] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)\n[01:54.70] All my niggas gon' ride (Yeah)\n[01:56.48] All my niggas gon' slide (Grrt, yeah)\n[02:03.08] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide (Oh yeah)\n[02:07.44] Hit him with the .9 (Brr, brr), knock him down to size (Brr, fuck)\n[02:20.20] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)","words":[[7.26,7.48,"[Intro]"],[7.86,8.04,"Mmmm"],[10.82,10.88,"(Ayy,"],[10.92,11.32,"KBeaZy,"],[11.78,11.82,"you"],[11.88,12.16,"fired"],[12.24,12.26,"up)"],[12.3,12.6,"[Verse"],[12.62,13.48,"1]"],[13.94,14.1,"Every"],[14.18,14.32,"day"],[14.42,14.42,"I"],[14.46,14.62,"wake"],[14.66,14.68,"up,"],[14.76,14.9,"get"],[14.94,14.96,"to"],[15.02,15.08,"the"],[15.18,15.5,"cake"],[15.64,15.86,"Rainy"],[15.94,15.96,"or"],[16.06,16.24,"sunny,"],[16.36,16.42,"it's"],[16.52,16.72,"money"],[16.82,16.86,"to"],[16.96,17.16,"make"],[17.28,17.36,"If"],[17.5,17.56,"I'm"],[17.62,17.8,"down"],[17.86,18.14,"bad,"],[18.22,18.28,"it's"],[18.32,18.48,"just"],[18.52,18.68,"too"],[18.78,19.04,"bad"],[19.22,19.42,"Hands"],[19.48,19.52,"in"],[19.56,19.6,"the"],[19.68,19.72,"air,"],[19.84,19.9,"all"],[19.96,20.06,"your"],[20.12,20.3,"money"],[20.34,20.46,"I'll"],[20.5,20.66,"take"],[20.7,21.02,"Sitting"],[21.08,21.18,"up"],[21.22,21.26,"in"],[21.3,21.34,"the"],[21.44,21.62,